      "title": "Runtime and dependencies",
      "items": [
        "app.py calls src.inference.answer_customer; adapter inference is enabled by default.",
        "The inference path uses PyTorch, Transformers, PEFT, and Hugging Face Hub; training adds datasets, TRL, and Accelerate.",
        "Evaluation is a separate command-line flow, not a Streamlit action."
      ]
    },
